                "reply_count": 68,
                "retweet_count": 19,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It\u2019s been 15 days since Republicans shut down the government. \n\n15 days without addressing the health care crisis. \n\n15 days federal workers have been dealing with uncertainty.\n\n15 days Republicans have been on vacation. \n\nI\u2019m in DC. It\u2019s time for Republicans to come to work, do their jobs and open the government.",
