                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Thanks to President Trump and Republicans\u2019 failure to extend the ACA tax credits, folks who rely on the ACA marketplace for health insurance could see their health care costs increase by up to 114% in 2026.\n\nThese rate increases will hit farmers, ranchers and rural Minnesota budgets hard.\n\nThis administration needs to stop saying it loves family farmers and start acting like it loves family farmers. It\u2019s time to come back to the table and address the health care crisis folks are facing now.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
