                "retweet_count": 12,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Because of Republicans\u2019 attacks on health care: a 60-year-old Minnesota couple will face a $15,500 premium increase.\n\nRepublicans campaigned on the promise of lowering costs and making life easier.\n\nInstead, they\u2019re giving handouts to billionaires, making it more expensive to put food on the table and tripling health care costs for hardworking Minnesotans. Make it make sense.",
