                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Small business owners make up 16% of the workforce but represent nearly half of the folks that rely on ACA premium tax credits for health care coverage.\n\nThanks to Republican efforts to rip these tax credits away, hardworking Americans will see increased premiums as soon as November 1.\n\nPresident Trump and Republicans are showing us yet again that they favor Wall Street over Main Street.",
