                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Open Enrollment for @MNSure starts today and will remain open until January 15.\n\nRepublicans are still refusing to come to the table to lower your health care costs \u2013 and folks across Minnesota are seeing their premiums increase.\n\nIf you or your loved ones are seeing your costs go up, I want to hear from you. Please share your story with me and my office here: https://t.co/NQGknDtzPH",
