                "text": "Trump\u2019s chaotic Admin has cancelled $60M worth of investments into MN-08.\n\nAnd thanks to the Republican health care crisis, health care premiums in MN-08 have increased by 219%.\n\nWhere is @RepPeteStauber? Minnesotans are losing jobs, health care and investments in their local economies and he\u2019s yet to speak out.",
