                "text": "Small business owners across Minnesota rely on the ACA tax credits for health care.\n\nBy letting the ACA credits expire, Republicans are putting the squeeze on our local businesses because their health care costs will go up.\n\nI\u2019m joining @RepNikkiB in pushing @SpeakerJohnson to extend the ACA credits \u2013 for the health of our communities and our economy.\n\nhttps://t.co/MVPMe8HfnU",
