                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In the 36 days since Republicans shut down the government, they have done a lot: they\u2019ve illegally denied food assistance to hungry kids, targeted federal workers and stood idly by while health care costs skyrocket for hardworking Americans.\n\nYou know what they haven\u2019t done? Show up to work.\n\nIt\u2019s time they get back to Washington and end this shutdown.",
