                "reply_count": 93,
                "retweet_count": 13,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As the GOP continues to attack the Affordable Care Act, I\u2019m thankful for @SpeakerPelosi, who led the charge to make health care accessible for all Americans.\u00a0\u00a0\n\nOne of my proudest moments in Congress was working with Speaker Pelosi to close the family glitch in 2022 \u2013 making health care more affordable for 62,000 Minnesotans.\u00a0\u00a0\n\nFor that and so much more: thank you, Madame Speaker.",
